{"id":"n92078-1-7","stage":2,"title":"사인 · 签字","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92078-1-7-1","ko":"이게 다 뭐야?","zh":"这都是些什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/68b4d236f023a697013a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n92078-1-7-2","ko":"내가 그동안 받은 연예인들의 사인을 모아 둔 거야.","zh":"这是我之前收集的所有艺人签名的合集。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间。","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}},{"text":"받은","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받은","audio":"/audio/135720fd9fd0e73d4239.mp3"}},{"text":"연예인들의","meaning":"艺人","explanation":"연예인：艺人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"연예인","audio":"/audio/c21f2e832c0791d63474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14021","senseId":"1","lemma":"연예인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연예인들의","audio":"/audio/51eb6161fdc67464e817.mp3"}},{"text":"사인을","meaning":"签字，署名","explanation":"사인：签字，署名；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사인","audio":"/audio/bdad6b39def03ef2885c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92078","senseId":"1","lemma":"사인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사인을","audio":"/audio/3a8b2e5fc52c4e5c2966.mp3"}},{"text":"모아","meaning":"收集，收藏","explanation":"모으다：收集，收藏；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"2","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모아","audio":"/audio/49ed4378fb75ee9006e5.mp3"}},{"text":"둔","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둔","audio":"/audio/116fbf2f245c5cf6c9f8.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"c21f2e832c0791d6","term":"연예인","zh":"艺人","audio":"/audio/c21f2e832c0791d63474.mp3","entryId":"14021","definition":"把演技、唱歌或跳舞等演艺活动作为职业的人。","pronunciation":["여ː녜인"]},{"id":"bdad6b39def03ef2","term":"사인","zh":"签字，署名","audio":"/audio/bdad6b39def03ef2885c.mp3","entryId":"92078","definition":"写上自己的名字；或指写上。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5ddf1bf1c10eabe3","term":"모으다","zh":"收集，收藏","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3","entryId":"74137","definition":"获取并保存特别的东西。","pronunciation":["모으다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/14b0faac97d6ec96c1af.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.288,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=92078"